--- !u!114 &336415448
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 336415447}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d33394b016351649a55fffbe3ae6ec4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  slotName: {fileID: 1222113649}
  slotDescription: {fileID: 326561676}
  BacteriaPurple:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 1182396787}
    button: {fileID: 1713050791}
    name: Streptococcus pneumonia
    description: "Streptococcus pneumonia is known in the game world as a silent
      invader that strikes when defenses grow weak. It drifts through the air unnoticed,
      settling deep within the lungs where it multiplies rapidly and clouds the battlefield
      with infection. Once ignored, it spreads beyond its first foothold, triggering
      fever, breathlessness, and confusion as it drains the host\u2019s strength
      from within. Clever and resilient, this enemy thrives on vulnerability, turning
      a moment of neglect into a full-scale assault, reminding players that even
      the smallest unseen foe can become a devastating threat if left unchecked."
  BacteriaRed:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 849999934}
    button: {fileID: 1897353583}
    name: Moracella xataralis
    description: "Moraxella catarrhalis appears in the game as an opportunistic enemy
      hiding in the upper airways. It remains quiet and unnoticed, blending into
      its surroundings while waiting for the host\u2019s defenses to weaken. When
      the moment comes, it turns aggressive and spreads through the sinuses, ears,
      and lungs. This enemy causes persistent inflammation that clogs passages and
      slows recovery. Moraxella catarrhalis teaches players that threats which seem
      harmless can become dangerous when vigilance fades."
  BacteriaGreen:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 1587534764}
    button: {fileID: 1342217424}
    name: Pseudomonas aeruginosa
    description: Pseudomonas aeruginosa appears in the game as a ruthless and highly
      adaptable enemy that thrives in harsh environments. It spreads through wounds
      and weakened systems, forming resilient colonies that are hard to eliminate.
      This pathogen releases toxic substances that slowly overwhelm defenses. Resistant
      and persistent, it refuses to retreat once established. Pseudomonas aeruginosa
      represents a dangerous late-game threat that punishes careless strategy.
  BacteriaBlue:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 669811257}
    button: {fileID: 529925670}
    name: Haemophilus influenzae
    description: Haemophilus influenzae appears in the game as a cunning enemy that
      exploits crowded airways and weakened defenses. It moves quickly through the
      respiratory passages, causing swelling and obstruction. Once established, it
      can trigger a chain of infections spreading toward the lungs. Subtle but dangerous,
      it strikes early and quietly. Haemophilus influenzae teaches players that ignoring
      small threats can shape the entire battle.
  BacteriaPink:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 217078816}
    button: {fileID: 1322723733}
    name: Esherchia Coli
    description: Escherichia coli is introduced in the game as a deceptive enemy
      that normally exists in balance but turns dangerous when it crosses forbidden
      boundaries. Once it escapes its usual territory, it unleashes powerful toxins
      that disrupt vital systems, causing chaos and rapid damage from within. This
      enemy spreads quickly through contaminated paths, overwhelming defenses before
      they can fully respond. Unpredictable and versatile, Escherichia coli symbolizes
      how familiar forces can become deadly threats when order is broken and control
      is lost.
  BacteriaOrange:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 1148163512}
    button: {fileID: 855907894}
    name: Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA)
    description: Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) appears in the
      game as a hardened elite enemy shaped by countless failed attempts to destroy
      it. It resists conventional attacks and adapts rapidly to incoming threats.
      Entering through wounds and close contact, it builds fortified strongholds
      that are difficult to break. Relentless and unforgiving, MRSA tests both strategy
      and patience. It represents the danger of enemies forged through resistance.
  BacteriaYellow:
    pictureObj: {fileID: 388676070}
    button: {fileID: 931636918}
    name: Staphylloccocus aureus
    description: Staphylococcus aureus appears in the game as a versatile and aggressive
      enemy that exploits close contact and exposed weaknesses. It enters through
      small wounds, multiplies rapidly, and releases damaging toxins. Though it seems
      manageable at first, it can quickly escalate into severe infections if ignored.
      Adaptable and relentless, it overwhelms the battlefield with pressure. Staphylococcus
      aureus teaches players not to underestimate common enemies.
