    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Bacteria Yellow is a resilient and unpredictable microorganism that represents
    a higher-level threat compared to common bacteria, characterized by its ability
    to survive longer under pressure and disrupt the balance of its surrounding environment.
    It moves with irregular patterns that make it difficult to anticipate, forcing
    defenders to stay alert and adapt their strategies rather than relying on fixed
    placements or single attack types. '
